{"id":"vano","lemma":"vano","pos":"adj","rank":3143,"glosses":["vain (overly proud of oneself)","vain (having no real substance)","vain (pointless, futile)"],"ipa":"/ˈbano/","forms":{"feminine":"vana","masculinePlural":"vanos","femininePlural":"vanas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/8e/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-vano.wav","examples":[{"text":"Ella intentó en vano no llorar.","en":"She tried in vain not to cry.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/705459","words":[{"g":"she"},{"g":"to try, to attempt","l":"intentar"},{"g":"in / on"},null,{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to cry, to weep"}]},{"text":"Sus acciones fueron en vano.","en":"Her actions were in vain.","words":[{"g":"his, her, its, their"},{"g":"action, act, deed","l":"acción"},{"g":"to go","l":"ir"},{"g":"in / on"},null]},{"text":"Tu muerte no habrá sido en vano.","en":"Your death will not have been in vain.","words":[{"g":"your"},{"g":"death"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"in / on"},null]},{"text":"Intentó en vano resolver el problema.","en":"He tried in vain to solve the problem.","words":[{"g":"to try, to attempt","l":"intentar"},{"g":"in / on"},null,{"g":"to resolve"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"problem"}]},{"text":"Todos mis esfuerzos fueron en vano.","en":"All my efforts were in vain.","words":[{"g":"all","l":"todo"},{"g":"my"},{"g":"effort, endeavor","l":"esfuerzo"},{"g":"to go","l":"ir"},{"g":"in / on"},null]}]}